---
---

<section id="recruit" class="section recruit">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">スタッフ募集</h2>
    <div class="recruit-banner">
      <p class="banner-lead">一緒に働く事務スタッフを募集しています</p>
      <div class="banner-positions">
        <span class="banner-tag">受付事務 — 平日17:00〜21:00／土日4時間程度</span>
        <span class="banner-tag">総務事務 — 診療時間外</span>
      </div>
      <p class="wage">いずれも時給 1,300円</p>
      <a href="/recruit" class="banner-btn">詳細・応募はこちら</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .recruit {
    background: white;
  }

  .recruit-banner {
    max-width: 560px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: var(--color-coral-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-coral);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 40px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .banner-lead {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .banner-positions {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .banner-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 8px 20px;
    background: white;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-coral);
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-navy);
  }

  .wage {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-coral);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .banner-btn {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 14px 36px;
    background: var(--color-coral);
    color: white;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    border-radius: 24px;
    transition: opacity 0.2s;
  }

  .banner-btn:hover {
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .recruit-banner {
      padding: 32px 24px;
    }
  }
</style>
